actor was declined due to the contractor’s cessation of operations.  \n3. **Maintain the special handling reference** – include **THN‑TPVT‑d2c1bab1705c** in any escalation or follow‑up correspondence, and update the claim status accordingly.  \n4. **Monitor the claim reserve** – the current reserve is **£21,700**; confirm that the paid amount (**£18,144**) aligns with the work completed and the special handling reference.  \n\nIf any further details (e.g., invoices, escalation emails) are needed, let me know and I can fetch the specific correspondence or related documents.", "response_hash": "sha256:fca2da22bba6a2aaddf38a0116c8cd51cf5466b5f74466097434fbb0284244f5", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
